 entering the campaign.","/GameMap/media/learning/beach-kitty-ai-campaign.webp","An orange cat runs along a sandy shore below a sunny sky in a CRT-style frame.","https://www.beachkittygame.games/","width",1280,"height",720,"GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)",[96,233],"Gemini model / AI Studio","Related resources",[237,238],"resourceIds",{"_52":96,"_27":97},{"_52":239,"_27":240},"Phaser · First Game Guide","/resources/phaser/","Creator evidence",[244],"evidence",{"_52":245,"_27":246,"_247":248},"See the author’s tool attribution","https://github.com/matthewod11-stack/CatRunner#built-with","note","The README names Claude Code and Gemini and distinguishes the playable campaign from its optional generation features.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[253],{"_52":254,"_27":255,"_247":256},"Open the complete campaign project","https://github.com/matthewod11-stack/CatRunner","Complete Phaser and React project with scenes, systems, assets, audio, API routes, and build configuration. Gemini is optional for the core game.","Access type","playable","Play or run",[261],{"_52":262,"_27":223,"_247":263},"Play Beach Kitty","Keyboard and touch controls are available. Early runner controls include Space or Up to jump, Down to duck, and P or Escape to pause.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","build log","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[271],{"_52":272,"_27":273,"_247":-7},"Read the development progress log","https://github.com/matthewod11-stack/CatRunner/blob/main/PROGRESS.md","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[278,279,280,281],"Play the campaign and compare how its scenes share one cat character.","Read the progress log alongside the author’s Claude Code and Gemini disclosure.","Inspect the Phaser scenes and React shell to understand their responsibilities.","Run npm install and npm run dev; the core game runs without a Gemini key.","AI workflow / foundation context