ion notes to see how parallel work was assigned and integrated.","The author documents a Claude Opus 4.6 agent team, shared scaffolding, separate file ownership, and the exact prompts assigned to each teammate.",[1347,1348,1349,1350],{"_52":1344,"_27":1345,"_19":302},{"_52":1340,"_27":1323,"_19":258,"_247":1341},{"_52":1335,"_27":1336,"_247":1337,"_300":301},{"_52":1330,"_27":1331,"_247":1332},[118,1014],"example:tron-exonix-claude","tron-exonix-claude","TRON: EXONIX","A neon 3D territory-capture game built through Claude Code, Godot MCP, Blender MCP, and generated assets, with human design and playtest feedback.","/examples/tron-exonix-claude/",{"_21":1359,"_23":1360,"_25":1361,"_108":1428,"_1150":1429,"_90":113,"_287":292,"_284":1422,"_9":1430,"_268":1431,"_20":1432,"_34":1433,"_243":1434,"_236":1435},[1365,1366,1367,1368,1369,1370,1371,1372,1373,1374,1375,1376,1377,1378,1379,1380,1381,1382,1383,1384],{"_50":23,"_54":1360,"_56":23,"_58":-7},{"_50":112,"_54":1361,"_56":25,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":289,"_54":1428,"_56":108,"_58":59},{"_50":229,"_52":1147,"_275":1148,"_62":1423,"_56":1150,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":88,"_54":89,"_56":90,"_58":91},{"_50":51,"_52":285,"_54":286,"_56":287,"_58":87},{"_50":51,"_52":282,"_54":1422,"_56":284,"_58":59},{"_50":229,"_52":274,"_275":276,"_62":1417,"_56":9,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":269,"_62":1413,"_56":268,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":266,"_54":268,"_56":268,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":264,"_54":265,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":259,"_62":1409,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":257,"_54":258,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":251,"_62":1404,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":249,"_54":250,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":241,"_62":1399,"_56":243,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":234,"_62":1390,"_56":236,"_58":-7},{"_50":229,"_56":230,"_52":231,"_62":1389},{"_50":219,"_56":116,"_52":1385,"_73":1386,"_83":1387,"_34":1388,"_224":225,"_226":227,"_57":228},{"_50":51,"_56":216,"_52":217,"_54":218},"The live Godot build: neon territory captur