 and materials. The repository includes the actual Godot game, generated assets, and the asset-generation scripts.",[1122,1424,1425,1151,1426,1427],"Nano Banana","PATINA","Stable Audio","ElevenLabs","Godot 4.7 · GDScript",[1122,1424,1425,1151,1426,1427],[1418,1419,1420,1421],{"_52":1415,"_27":1416,"_19":268},{"_52":1411,"_27":1388,"_19":258,"_247":1412},{"_52":1406,"_27":1407,"_300":301,"_247":1408},{"_52":1401,"_27":1402,"_247":1403},[118,381,1436,1437],"godot-mcp","mcp-for-blender","example:arkanoid-neon-claude","arkanoid-neon-claude","Arkanoid Neon","Bounce the ball through eight neon brick layouts, collect power-ups and keep the rally alive as the stages accelerate. This complete browser game uses Canvas 2D and synthesized Web Audio.","/examples/arkanoid-neon-claude/",{"_21":1439,"_23":1440,"_25":1441,"_108":1499,"_90":291,"_287":515,"_284":1498,"_9":1500,"_268":1501,"_20":1502,"_34":1503,"_243":1504,"_236":1505},[1445,1446,1447,1448,1449,1450,1451,1452,1453,1454,1455,1456,1457,1458,1459,1460,1461,1462,1463,1464],{"_50":23,"_54":1440,"_56":23,"_58":-7},{"_50":112,"_54":1441,"_56":25,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":289,"_54":1499,"_56":108,"_58":59},{"_50":51,"_52":88,"_54":288,"_56":90,"_58":91},{"_50":51,"_52":285,"_54":513,"_56":287,"_58":87},{"_50":51,"_52":282,"_54":1498,"_56":284,"_58":59},{"_50":229,"_52":274,"_275":276,"_62":1493,"_56":9,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":269,"_62":1490,"_56":268,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":266,"_54":847,"_56":268,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":264,"_54":265,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":259,"_62":1485,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":257,"_54":258,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":251,"_62":1480,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":249,"_54":250,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":241,"_62":1476,"_56":243,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":234,"_62":1474,"_56":236,"_58":-7},{"_50":229,"_56":230,"_52":231,"_62":1473},{"_50":219,"_56":116,"_52":1469,"_73":1470,"_83":1471,"_34":1472,"_224":225,"_226":227,"_57":341},{"_50":51,"_56":335,"_52":336,"_54":1468},{"_50":60,"_56":330,"_52":331,"_62":1465},[1466],{"_52":331,"_27":1467},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Jack-c3l2w/arkanoid-neon/main/screenshots/gameplay.png","2026-10-20","The creator’s full portrait brick-breaker screenshot, preserved with side padding.","/GameMap/media/learning/arkanoid-neon-claude.webp","A neon brick-breaker field with rainbow rows of bricks, a glowing ball and paddle, score and round indicators.","https://github.com/Jack-c3l2w/arkanoid-neon#readme",[96],[1475],{"_52":96,"_27":97},[1477],{"_52":1478,"_27":1472,"_247":1479},"Read the creator’s Claude Code attribution","The creator directly names Claude Code and its model, separates the original request from the finished project, and describes code-generated art/audio. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[1481],{"_52":1482,"_27":1483,"_247":1484},"Open the complete browser game","https://github.com/Jack-c3l2w/arkanoid-neon","Complete index.html, style.css and game.js with procedural graphics and audio; open index.html locally, no build step. Google Fonts is optional and falls back to system fonts offline. No root LICENSE was found. Fan project inspired by Arkanoid, not affiliated with Taito.",[1486],{"_52":1487,"_27":1488,"_247":1489},"Play Arkanoid Neon","https://jack-c3l2w.github.io/arkanoid-neon/","Mouse, arrows or A/D move; click/Space launches and fires; P/Esc pauses. Touch drag and tap are supported.",[1491],{"_52":1492,"_27":1472,"_247":-7},"Read the creator’s original request",[1494,1495,1496,1497],"Play a stage and compare paddle control, collision behavior, power-ups and losing a life.","Read the creator’s original Swedish request and AI attribution.","Open index.html locally and trace the game loop, level data and procedural graphics in game.js.","Ask an agent to change one brick pattern or power-up, then test launching, losing a life and restarting.","The creator’s Swedish README attributes the code, graphics, sound, music and levels to Claude Code using Claud