ocumentation with specialist agents. Pokemon data, sprites and some PixelLab artwork have separate credits and rights.","Babylon.js · TypeScript",[1631,1632,1633,1634],{"_52":1629,"_27":1615,"_19":436},{"_52":1623,"_27":1624,"_19":258,"_247":1625},{"_52":355,"_27":1619,"_247":1620,"_300":301},{"_52":1548,"_27":1615,"_247":1616},[118],"example:castle-clash-duel-claude","castle-clash-duel-claude","Castle Clash Duel","Recruit warriors and archers and fight a two-player tactical battle on a tilemap. This complete Phaser prototype pairs Claude Code implementation with Pixel Frog’s Tiny Swords artwork.","/examples/castle-clash-duel-claude/",{"_21":1644,"_23":1645,"_25":1646,"_108":1702,"_90":291,"_287":292,"_284":1701,"_9":1703,"_268":1704,"_20":1705,"_34":1706,"_243":1707,"_236":1708},[1650,1651,1652,1653,1654,1655,1656,1657,1658,1659,1660,1661,1662,1663,1664,1665,1666,1667,1668,1669],{"_50":23,"_54":1645,"_56":23,"_58":-7},{"_50":112,"_54":1646,"_56":25,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":289,"_54":1702,"_56":108,"_58":59},{"_50":51,"_52":88,"_54":288,"_56":90,"_58":91},{"_50":51,"_52":285,"_54":286,"_56":287,"_58":87},{"_50":51,"_52":282,"_54":1701,"_56":284,"_58":59},{"_50":229,"_52":274,"_275":276,"_62":1696,"_56":9,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":269,"_62":1693,"_56":268,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":266,"_54":267,"_56":268,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":264,"_54":265,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":259,"_62":1688,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":257,"_54":258,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":251,"_62":1684,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":249,"_54":250,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":241,"_62":1681,"_56":243,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":234,"_62":1678,"_56":236,"_58":-7},{"_50":229,"_56":230,"_52":231,"_62":1677},{"_50":219,"_56":116,"_52":1673,"_73":1674,"_83":1675,"_34":1676,"_224":225,"_226":227,"_57":341},{"_50":51,"_56":335,"_52":336,"_54":1468},{"_50":60,"_56":330,"_52":331,"_62":1670},[1671],{"_52":331,"_27":1672},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chongdashu/phaserjs-tinyswords/main/docs/preview.gif","A still from the creator’s gameplay animation, showing lane combat and castle health.","/GameMap/media/learning/castle-clash-duel-claude.webp","Two opposing castles and small fantasy units fighting along a winding lane, with health counters and a match timer.","https://github.com/chongdashu/phaserjs-tinyswords#implementation-with-agent-skills",[96],[1679,1680],{"_52":96,"_27":97},{"_52":239,"_27":240},[1682],{"_52":1548,"_27":1676,"_247":1683},"README explains PRD-to-code workflow, asset metadata and UI/test implementation; docs/prd.md and docs/tdd.md are published. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.",[1685],{"_52":355,"_27":1686,"_247":1687},"https://github.com/chongdashu/phaserjs-tinyswords","Full public/index.html game, Tiny Swords assets, PRD, technical design and UI test harness are included. Open public/index.html in a modern browser. No root LICENSE was found; artwork retains Pixel Frog terms. Do not assume unrestricted reuse.",[1689],{"_52":1690,"_27":1691,"_247":1692},"Play Castle Clash Duel","https://vibe-tiny-swords.vercel.app/","Author-linked browser prototype with mouse or touch controls. The local public/index.html loads Phaser 3.70.0 from a CDN.",[1694],{"_52":1695,"_27":1676,"_247":-7},"Read the PRD-to-game workflow",[1697,1698,1699,1700],"Play a two-player battle and identify recruitment, movement, attacks and castle victory conditions.","Read the published PRD and technical design before tracing the game’s single-file scene logic.","Inspect the Tiny Swords asset metadata and the custom panels used to handle sprite padding.","Change one unit or UI rule with an agent, then replay the battle and inspect the included test harness.","The creator combined a PRD, technical design and curated asset metadata with three Claude Code skills for Phaser gameplay, tilemaps and frontend testing. Human-made Tiny Swords assets are credited separately; this is a prototype.","Phaser 3 · JavaScript",[1697,1698,1699,1700],{"_52":1695,"_27":1676,"_19":302},{"_52":1690,"_27":1691,"_19":258,"_247":1692},{"_52":355,"_27":1686,"_247":1687,"_300":301},{"_52":1548,"_27":1676,"_247":1683},[118,299],"example:morbreaker-unity-claude","morbreaker-unity-claude","morBreaker","Clear ten brick-breaker levels with a paddle-controlled ball that accelerates on bounces, rising brick durability, and locally saved high scores.","/examples/morbreaker-unity-claude/",{"_21":1710,"_23":1711,"_25":1712,"_108":1768,"_90":291,"_287":292,"_284":1767,"_9":1769,"_268":1770,"_20":1771,"_34":1772,"_243":1773,"_236":1774},[1716,1717,1718,1719,1720,1721,1722,1723,1724,1725,1726,1727,1728,1729,1730,1731,1732,1733,1734],{"_50":23,"_54":1711,"_56":23,"_58":-7},{"_50":112,"_54":1712,"_56":25,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":289,"_54":1768,"_56":108,"_58":59},{"_50":51,"_52":88,"_54":288,"_56":90,"_58":91},{"_50":51,"_52":285,"_54":286,"_56":287,"_58":87},{"_50":51,"_52":282,"_54":1767,"_56":284,"_58":59},{"_50":229,"_52":274,"_275":276,"_62":1762,"_56":9,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":269,"_62":1759,"_56":268,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":266,"_54":436,"_56":268,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":264,"_54":364,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":259,"_62":1754,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":257,"_54":358,"_56":20,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":251,"_62":1750,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":51,"_52":249,"_54":250,"_56":34,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":241,"_62":1745,"_56":243,"_58":-7},{"_50":60,"_52":234,"_62":1740,"_56":236,"_58":-7},{"_50":229,"_56":230,"_52":231,"_62":1739},{"_50":219,"_56":116,"_52":1735,"_73":1736,"_83":1737,"_34":1738,"_224":225,"_226":227,"_57":413},{"_50":51,"_56":216,"_52":217,"_54":1468},"Gameplay captured from the creator’s published WebGL build.","/GameMap/media/learning/morbreaker-unity-claude.webp","morBreaker gameplay with a paddle, ball, coloured brick grid, and score display.","https://github.com/KingMordas/mor-breaker",[96],[1741,1742],{"_52":1743,"_27":1744},{"_52":96,"_27":97},"Unity · Manual","/resources/unity-engine/",[1746],{"_52":1747,"_27":1748,"_247":1749},"Read the explicit Claude Code contribution breakdown","https://github.com/KingMordas/mor-breaker#built-with-claude-code-","Creator disclosure names the Unity MCP package and lists the editor work Claude performed. It is a process summary, not a published prompt transcript.",[1751],{"_52":1752,"_27":1738,"_247":1753},"Open the complete Unity game","MIT-licensed Assets, Packages, ProjectSettings, scenes, and C# gameplay source. Requires Unity 6000.4.11f1; open Assets/Scenes/SampleScene.unity and press Play. Windows/WebGL build modules are needed only for packaging; Claude/MCP tooling is not required for play.",[1755],{"_52":1756,"_27":1757,"_247":1758},"Download morBreaker for Windows or WebGL","https://github.com/KingMordas/mor-breaker/releases/tag/v1.2.0","Version 1.2.0 includes Windows standalone and WebGL ZIPs. Extract the Windows build and launch it, or serve the WebGL build over HTTP. A/D or arrows move, Space launches, H shows scores, and Space/Enter restarts. Pointer/touch controls are included; no public hosted play link is supplied.",[1760],{"_52":1761,"_27":1748,"_247":-7},"Read the creator’s Unity and Claude Code account",[1763,1764,1765,1766],"Download the Windows release or serve the published WebGL build over HTTP.","Try paddle steering, acceleration, loss, restart, and the local score list.","Read the creator’s Claude Code disclosure and inspect the gameplay C# scripts.","Open SampleScene.unity with Unity 6000.4.11f1, change one level rule, and test progression.","KingMordas says Claude Code built almost the entire game through the Unity MCP plugin: gameplay scripts, scene and prefab wiring, tests, and documentation. The AI editor tooling is separate from the released game runtime.","Unity 6 · URP · C#",[1763,1764,1765,1766],{"_52":1761,"_27":1748,"_19":436},{"_52":1756,"_27":1757,"_19":358,"_247":1758},{"_52":1752,"_27":1738,"_300":301,"_247":1753},{"_52":1747,"_27":1748,"_247":1749},[1775,118],"unity-engine","ex